<title>USA: USFreightways files to offer 2.7 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>USFreightways files to offer 2.7 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEMONT, Ill. 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>USFreightways Corp said Monday it has filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission to sell 2.7 million shares of its common stock.  </p>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co and Schroeder Wertheim &amp; Co will manage the offering, the freight carrier said.</p>
<p>USFreightways shares were unchanged at 27-1/4 Monday.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
